WEBVTT

1
00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:02.765
<i>During the 1620s, Wei Zhongxian, Head Eunuch
and Head of the Imperial Assassins...</i>

2
00:01:03.008 --> 00:01:05.967
<i>had been having his way in the Imperial
Court for eight years.</i>

3
00:01:06.602 --> 00:01:09.115
<i>At that time, seven out of ten
Court Officials...</i>

4
00:01:09.223 --> 00:01:12.200
<i>were Wei's followers,
known as "the Eunuch's Clique".</i>

5
00:01:13.774 --> 00:01:15.833
<i>When Emperor Chongzhen
came into power,</i>

6
00:01:15.922 --> 00:01:19.321
<i>he relieved Wei of all duties and sent
him to the remote outpost of Fengyang.</i>

7
00:01:19.874 --> 00:01:22.140
<i>Although Wei had fallen,
the Clique was still there.</i>

8
00:01:22.342 --> 00:01:25.989
<i>Chongzhen wanted every member of
the Clique arrested.</i>

9
00:01:27.347 --> 00:01:29.334
It sure is cold, Master Ma.

10
00:01:29.523 --> 00:01:31.279
A nice bowl of noodles would warm us up,

11
00:01:31.355 --> 00:01:32.531
wouldn't it?

12
00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:34.090
Noodles...

13
00:01:34.945 --> 00:01:36.301
at this hour,

14
00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.711
only two kinds of people are outside...

15
00:01:38.835 --> 00:01:40.393
besides the night watchmen.

16
00:01:40.461 --> 00:01:42.165
There's us,

17
00:01:42.923 --> 00:01:44.463
sent by rotten luck...

18
00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:46.188
to patrol the grounds.

19
00:01:48.089 --> 00:01:49.433
And then there's...

20
00:01:51.104 --> 00:01:53.043
What did you see?

21
00:01:57.802 --> 00:01:59.656
Get out of there.

22
00:02:09.859 --> 00:02:11.423
An Imperial Assassin!

23
00:02:12.588 --> 00:02:13.667
What's wrong?

24
00:02:13.806 --> 00:02:15.534
Lets get out of here. Come.

25
00:02:18.814 --> 00:02:23.343
<i>[ The Imperial assassins are arresting
the Eunuch Clique member Xu Xianchun. ]</i>

26
00:02:29.718 --> 00:02:31.039
5 o'clock... remember 5 o'clock.

27
00:02:31.178 --> 00:02:33.239
Take Xianchun with you to Xizhimen,

28
00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:36.312
and take this letter to Sir Cao.

29
00:02:36.377 --> 00:02:37.948
You will leave the city in the water cart.

30
00:02:38.068 --> 00:02:39.380
I'll remember that.

31
00:02:42.339 --> 00:02:44.869
What is all this?
Why aren't you dressed properly?

32
00:02:45.635 --> 00:02:48.051
Sister-in-law, what's the matter?

33
00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:52.616
Sir Chen!

34
00:02:52.988 --> 00:02:54.783
I'm from the North Zhenfu Division.

35
00:02:54.862 --> 00:02:56.338
My name is Shen Lian.

36
00:03:02.129 --> 00:03:04.380
Please don't be alarmed.
- I'm not alarmed!

37
00:03:05.172 --> 00:03:07.367
Sir Shen,
even Imperial Assassins...

38
00:03:07.467 --> 00:03:08.950
need an explanation...

39
00:03:09.168 --> 00:03:10.660
for storming my residence.

40
00:03:10.725 --> 00:03:12.074
You know perfectly well...

41
00:03:12.234 --> 00:03:13.882
why I'm here!

42
00:03:59.669 --> 00:04:01.787
Sir Chen,
he only has one arm left.

43
00:04:03.253 --> 00:04:04.765
Do you want him to keep it?

44
00:04:07.064 --> 00:04:08.618
You know what I want.

45
00:04:14.116 --> 00:04:15.468
Arrest me then.

46
00:04:16.009 --> 00:04:17.523
I know your methods!

47
00:04:17.825 --> 00:04:19.463
I can handle the tortures.

48
00:04:34.849 --> 00:04:36.910
Leave my daughter alone...
she's only 14!

49
00:04:37.102 --> 00:04:40.389
Leave my daughter alone, she's only 14!

50
00:04:43.782 --> 00:04:45.729
If she ends up as a courtesan
at the Academy,

51
00:04:45.989 --> 00:04:48.571
it will be because...
you harbored a member of the Clique.

52
00:04:56.766 --> 00:04:59.194
Where is Xu Xianchun?
Tell me...

53
00:04:59.334 --> 00:05:00.899
and I'll leave.

54
00:05:01.425 --> 00:05:02.872
Never to return!

55
00:05:20.276 --> 00:05:21.681
Go!

56
00:05:37.728 --> 00:05:39.941
Sir Chen,
if you do me a favor...

57
00:05:40.235 --> 00:05:42.263
no one in your family gets hurt!

58
00:05:58.088 --> 00:05:59.259
Sir Xu...

59
00:05:59.601 --> 00:06:01.099
please come with us.

60
00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:51.987
Run Sir.
We'll take care of him.

61
00:07:12.304 --> 00:07:14.599
Lui Jianxing,
I know why you're doing this...

62
00:07:14.733 --> 00:07:17.253
It's because I didn't promote you
to the rank of Baihu.

63
00:07:18.217 --> 00:07:19.728
Lui Jianxing, let me go!

64
00:07:19.897 --> 00:07:21.842
If you do, I promise I'll promote you.

65
00:07:27.618 --> 00:07:29.374
Lian!
- Yichuan.

66
00:07:31.544 --> 00:07:33.103
Even Wei Zhongxian is down,

67
00:07:33.206 --> 00:07:35.921
and this ex-Commander is still
so high and mighty.

68
00:07:37.007 --> 00:07:39.812
Jianxing...
the roots of the Clique run deep!

69
00:07:41.179 --> 00:07:42.957
Those bastards higher up...

70
00:07:43.104 --> 00:07:44.915
only remember the three of us...

71
00:07:44.994 --> 00:07:47.308
when there is a tricky mission like this.

72
00:07:47.873 --> 00:07:50.922
You're right,
but I'm afraid it's just our lot...

73
00:07:51.384 --> 00:07:53.496
to deal with this kind of business.

74
00:08:00.437 --> 00:08:01.754
Hey, Lian...

75
00:08:03.768 --> 00:08:05.286
Listen...

76
00:08:12.233 --> 00:08:13.510
I get it.

77
00:08:14.678 --> 00:08:16.714
Yichuan...

78
00:08:17.009 --> 00:08:18.901
you can not go on like this forever.

79
00:08:28.018 --> 00:08:29.967
<i>My good sir, it's getting late.</i>

80
00:08:30.155 --> 00:08:31.708
<i>Why don't you come back tomorrow?</i>

81
00:08:31.775 --> 00:08:33.967
<i>You bitch.
How dare you disrespect me!</i>

82
00:08:34.358 --> 00:08:36.063
<i>Even if I have to pay double the price...</i>

83
00:08:36.137 --> 00:08:38.397
<i>I will still bed Zhou Miaotong today!</i>

84
00:08:47.799 --> 00:08:49.380
Come to bed.

85
00:08:49.731 --> 00:08:51.215
I have to go to work soon.

86
00:08:56.523 --> 00:08:58.126
You're an interesting character.

87
00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.460
Of all our customers...

88
00:09:04.052 --> 00:09:05.787
you're the only one who pays...

89
00:09:06.578 --> 00:09:08.712
but doesn't come to bed.

90
00:09:11.922 --> 00:09:13.401
I'm happy to sit here.

91
00:09:17.126 --> 00:09:20.760
<i>Of all the houses...
I picked yours tonight.</i>

92
00:09:21.431 --> 00:09:24.681
<i>Have that Zhou girl cleaned up
and see me.</i>

93
00:09:26.342 --> 00:09:28.817
As soon as I've saved enough,
I'll buy your freedom!

94
00:09:32.387 --> 00:09:34.161
Please, Mr. Officer...

95
00:09:35.237 --> 00:09:37.115
with your salary?

96
00:09:37.469 --> 00:09:38.949
You're joking!

97
00:09:39.224 --> 00:09:42.033
Besides, this is the brothel
of the Academy.

98
00:09:43.079 --> 00:09:44.782
Without an official permission...

99
00:09:45.153 --> 00:09:47.717
no one gets out!

100
00:09:49.949 --> 00:09:51.965
Sir Chen, I need a favor.

101
00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.850
I need you...

102
00:09:54.025 --> 00:09:56.380
to help me release a courtesan from
the Academy.

103
00:10:03.994 --> 00:10:06.528
It's morning already.
I have to go.

104
00:10:07.748 --> 00:10:09.861
Next time, don't bother to change.

105
00:10:13.862 --> 00:10:15.969
I thought you might not like the uniform.

106
00:10:16.804 --> 00:10:18.556
Everybody here knows...

107
00:10:19.216 --> 00:10:21.546
that you're Sir Shen of the
Imperial Assassins.

108
00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.265
Xiu!

109
00:11:08.922 --> 00:11:10.545
What's the matter?

110
00:11:11.676 --> 00:11:13.616
Afraid your officer friends might see me?

111
00:11:16.254 --> 00:11:19.042
Don't worry, they're far away.

112
00:11:20.697 --> 00:11:22.183
Xiu,

113
00:11:22.456 --> 00:11:24.006
just take this...

114
00:11:24.211 --> 00:11:25.727
and go!

115
00:11:27.849 --> 00:11:29.742
It's better then nothing.

116
00:11:30.922 --> 00:11:33.527
This is the last time,
I don't want to see you again.

117
00:11:34.909 --> 00:11:38.258
You think this uniform turns you into
a respectable person?

118
00:11:39.811 --> 00:11:41.677
A thief will always be a thief.

119
00:11:42.131 --> 00:11:43.573
This secret of yours...

120
00:11:43.718 --> 00:11:45.351
will keep me well-fed forever.

121
00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.461
Think I'm bluffing?

122
00:11:56.624 --> 00:12:00.177
I'll give you three days...
to get together 100 silver taels.

123
00:12:00.434 --> 00:12:02.075
100 taels...

124
00:12:02.756 --> 00:12:04.384
I make 20 taels a year.

125
00:12:04.739 --> 00:12:06.365
Where would I get a 100?

126
00:12:09.613 --> 00:12:11.142
Go peddle your ass.

127
00:12:11.594 --> 00:12:14.472
Quite a few high officials...
who have a thing for pretty boys.

128
00:12:14.699 --> 00:12:16.151
With your looks,

129
00:12:16.317 --> 00:12:18.923
100 taels...
would be a piece of cake.

130
00:12:43.818 --> 00:12:45.559
Trying to kill me again?

131
00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:51.781
I don't see what's so special about you...

132
00:12:52.002 --> 00:12:54.528
that made Master favor you over me.

133
00:12:55.502 --> 00:12:56.783
Three days...

134
00:13:10.635 --> 00:13:13.345
Sir.
- Lui Jianxing, you're quite an early bird.

135
00:13:13.462 --> 00:13:16.381
I spent the night here
after work yesterday.

136
00:13:17.433 --> 00:13:19.104
And Sir Xui...

137
00:13:20.792 --> 00:13:22.214
Xui Xianchun is under custody?

138
00:13:22.949 --> 00:13:23.972
Yes!

139
00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:26.140
This is really thanks to your carefull
planning, Sir.

140
00:13:26.366 --> 00:13:29.830
All the credit should go to you...
as I wrote in my report.

141
00:13:30.529 --> 00:13:31.939
Very well.

142
00:13:32.984 --> 00:13:34.639
It's to early for any work.

143
00:13:34.899 --> 00:13:36.232
Go get some rest.

144
00:13:40.227 --> 00:13:42.009
Anything else?
- Well...

145
00:13:42.658 --> 00:13:44.919
actually we talked about it already.

146
00:13:45.463 --> 00:13:46.966
It's about my promotion.

147
00:13:47.481 --> 00:13:49.522
I knew you wouldn't be here for no reason!

148
00:13:49.713 --> 00:13:51.333
I still haven't heard back from anyone.

149
00:13:52.668 --> 00:13:55.788
Sir...
I gave you silver for the bribes.

150
00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:58.218
I even gave you credit for last night!

151
00:13:58.288 --> 00:14:00.309
Lui Jianxing,
you have some bloody nerve!

152
00:14:00.998 --> 00:14:03.879
In that case,
I want none of your credit...

153
00:14:04.107 --> 00:14:07.231
and you can stop pestering me about
this promotion. - Sir!

154
00:14:09.223 --> 00:14:12.327
Apologies, sir.
I meant no offense. Please forgive me.

155
00:14:12.772 --> 00:14:14.553
It's just that my mother keeps asking...

156
00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:16.205
when I'll take over my father's position.

157
00:14:16.274 --> 00:14:17.507
That's enough!

158
00:14:17.915 --> 00:14:19.397
The silver you gave me...

159
00:14:19.462 --> 00:14:21.123
only goes as far as Sir Qianhu.

160
00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.710
Everyone needs to be bribed.

161
00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:28.017
Either...
bring me more silver,

162
00:14:29.012 --> 00:14:30.212
or...

163
00:14:30.365 --> 00:14:31.924
learn to be patient.

164
00:14:47.733 --> 00:14:50.597
Sir Zhao, - Sir Zhao...

165
00:14:54.808 --> 00:14:56.803
Which one is Lui Jianxing?

166
00:15:04.083 --> 00:15:06.401
Do you know when Wei Zhongxian
left the city?

167
00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.104
Your Excellency,
the day before yesterday.

168
00:15:09.286 --> 00:15:10.843
If you leave now,

169
00:15:11.117 --> 00:15:12.925
when can you catch up with him?

170
00:15:15.686 --> 00:15:18.229
If the horses are fast,
in Fucheng County by midnight.

171
00:15:23.755 --> 00:15:25.664
Good. You three, go do that!

172
00:15:28.475 --> 00:15:30.098
Your Excellency?

173
00:15:32.411 --> 00:15:34.282
His Majesty wants Wei Zhongxian dead.

174
00:15:40.728 --> 00:15:41.972
Your Excellency,

175
00:15:42.073 --> 00:15:43.872
why the three of us?

176
00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:49.681
Look at how shabby you are.

177
00:15:51.049 --> 00:15:52.957
There's no way you're part of the Clique.

178
00:15:56.192 --> 00:15:58.128
Sir, Fucheng County is right ahead.

179
00:15:58.363 --> 00:16:00.675
Once we're inside guard the four gates.

180
00:16:00.775 --> 00:16:02.284
No one gets in or out.

181
00:16:03.846 --> 00:16:06.189
Split into teams.
Inspect all Inns, big or small.

182
00:16:07.322 --> 00:16:08.559
Get out!

183
00:16:08.613 --> 00:16:10.218
How dare you throw us out!

184
00:16:23.389 --> 00:16:25.269
Wei Zhongxian must be inside that Inn.

185
00:16:30.996 --> 00:16:32.531
Don't send out the signal.

186
00:16:32.598 --> 00:16:34.265
There's no way the three of us...

187
00:16:34.337 --> 00:16:35.992
can handle this on our own!

188
00:16:36.493 --> 00:16:38.381
With us three getting this mission...

189
00:16:38.463 --> 00:16:40.413
plenty of people must be jealous.

190
00:16:40.638 --> 00:16:42.300
Zhang Ying is not happy either.

191
00:16:42.908 --> 00:16:44.672
He might have placed moles
among our men.

192
00:16:44.748 --> 00:16:46.428
If he wants to jeopardize this mission!

193
00:16:46.673 --> 00:16:48.365
Even our lives are at risk!

194
00:16:48.439 --> 00:16:49.684
Are you trying to make sure...

195
00:16:49.738 --> 00:16:51.682
that we get all the credit for this one?

196
00:16:53.633 --> 00:16:55.443
Think it through, I mean it!

197
00:16:55.923 --> 00:16:58.762
Lian...
are you not fed up with this life?

198
00:16:58.988 --> 00:17:00.602
We have no silver and no connections.

199
00:17:00.672 --> 00:17:03.100
What we need is an opportunity,
an opportunity...

200
00:17:03.205 --> 00:17:04.776
to get on top!

201
00:17:08.607 --> 00:17:10.424
Yichuan, what do you think?

202
00:17:17.912 --> 00:17:20.299
It's so cold...
Come sit by the fire.

203
00:18:25.089 --> 00:18:27.006
You lowlives have got some guts...

204
00:18:27.099 --> 00:18:28.922
making a scene here.

205
00:18:40.339 --> 00:18:41.937
Kill them.
- Lady...

206
00:18:42.006 --> 00:18:43.443
they're Imperial Assassins!

207
00:18:43.506 --> 00:18:45.457
Only three of them,
nothing to be scared of.

208
00:18:46.277 --> 00:18:48.471
For each head...
you get 10 taels of gold.

209
00:18:52.077 --> 00:18:53.350
Give it a try!

210
00:18:54.897 --> 00:18:56.246
Kill them.

211
00:19:09.385 --> 00:19:10.667
Block the gate!

212
00:19:40.725 --> 00:19:42.342
Get upstairs!
- Okay.

213
00:20:13.871 --> 00:20:15.536
Sir Wei...

214
00:20:36.424 --> 00:20:41.084
Officer...
even if you cut off my head,

215
00:20:43.159 --> 00:20:45.700
you still have plenty to deal with.

216
00:20:46.765 --> 00:20:49.351
What kind of trouble...
could you possibly have?

217
00:20:51.566 --> 00:20:53.965
Why does that boy Chongzhan
want to kill me?

218
00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.825
Is it because I deserve to die?

219
00:21:02.449 --> 00:21:04.766
You underestimate His majesty.

220
00:21:06.939 --> 00:21:09.315
I was in power for eight years.

221
00:21:09.521 --> 00:21:11.193
Now, my power is gone.

222
00:21:11.369 --> 00:21:13.996
All that I have left is lots of money.

223
00:21:14.771 --> 00:21:17.446
Bandits and Manchurians
are harrassing the borders.

224
00:21:17.561 --> 00:21:19.193
What His Majesty needs is a fortune...

225
00:21:19.264 --> 00:21:22.806
to fund his armies...
and he has his eyes on mine!

226
00:21:23.046 --> 00:21:26.070
If you don't bring him my money,
your trouble's only starting.

227
00:21:36.112 --> 00:21:37.361
If we kill you,

228
00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:39.397
we'll certainly bring back your money.

229
00:21:43.464 --> 00:21:44.889
It isn't here.

230
00:21:57.068 --> 00:21:59.274
400 taels of gold.

231
00:22:04.484 --> 00:22:06.055
Open the door.

232
00:22:21.832 --> 00:22:24.101
How much do you make a year?

233
00:22:24.874 --> 00:22:26.552
A handful of this is worth...

234
00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:28.659
30 years of your salary.

235
00:22:29.391 --> 00:22:31.561
Let me live,
and it's all yours.

236
00:22:32.274 --> 00:22:33.926
This money will get me killed.

237
00:22:34.292 --> 00:22:35.905
If you kill me...

238
00:22:36.544 --> 00:22:38.899
my followers
will hunt you down one by one.

239
00:22:39.104 --> 00:22:41.237
Don't even dream of saving your skins.

240
00:22:42.316 --> 00:22:43.808
This money here...

241
00:22:43.873 --> 00:22:45.217
take it and you die.

242
00:22:45.479 --> 00:22:47.256
Don't take it, you die aswell.

243
00:22:47.333 --> 00:22:49.041
Why don't you take a change...

244
00:22:49.115 --> 00:22:50.812
Sir Shen!

245
00:22:54.216 --> 00:22:55.509
You know me?

246
00:22:57.806 --> 00:22:59.528
I was head of the Secret Police,

247
00:22:59.603 --> 00:23:01.518
we kept an eye on everyone!

248
00:23:01.601 --> 00:23:04.934
From the commanders
to the petty officers.

249
00:23:05.771 --> 00:23:07.365
I know every one of you.

250
00:23:09.885 --> 00:23:11.424
Go, kill them.

251
00:23:17.511 --> 00:23:20.642
Make a deal with me,
and I'll tell you where the money is.

252
00:23:20.881 --> 00:23:22.949
Bring it back,
and your mission will be a succes.

253
00:23:23.038 --> 00:23:24.635
<i>Lian! Lian!</i>

254
00:23:24.808 --> 00:23:26.316
<i>Jianxing, watch out!</i>

255
00:23:27.082 --> 00:23:28.663
Make up your mind.

256
00:23:28.978 --> 00:23:31.609
Or your two friends want last much longer.

257
00:23:32.749 --> 00:23:35.967
This... all yours...
all yours...

258
00:23:44.161 --> 00:23:45.730
Who sent you?

259
00:23:47.266 --> 00:23:48.848
He's nothing but a pawn,

260
00:23:50.428 --> 00:23:51.992
just like you.

261
00:24:04.364 --> 00:24:06.267
Lady, it's on fire upstairs.
- Go upstairs!

262
00:24:06.349 --> 00:24:08.556
Wei Zhongxian is dead.

263
00:24:08.810 --> 00:24:11.457
The Eunuch is dead, drop your weapons!

264
00:24:39.794 --> 00:24:41.718
Your Excellency.

265
00:24:42.227 --> 00:24:43.900
Let me introduce the new Grand
Secretary of Cabinet.

266
00:24:43.973 --> 00:24:45.312
Sir Han Kuang.

267
00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:46.862
Greet him.

268
00:24:47.629 --> 00:24:49.193
Sir Han.

269
00:24:56.702 --> 00:24:58.831
So this is...
Wei the Eunuch?

270
00:24:59.093 --> 00:25:00.659
Yes, sir.
- Open it.

271
00:25:10.334 --> 00:25:13.497
It's so badly burnt.
How do I know it's really him?

272
00:25:14.222 --> 00:25:15.773
Here is his tablet.

273
00:25:23.430 --> 00:25:25.608
How did he die?
- He set himself on fire.

274
00:25:25.702 --> 00:25:28.251
Did you see him do it with your own eyes?
- Yes.

275
00:25:28.361 --> 00:25:30.106
Then why didn't you stop him?

276
00:25:34.888 --> 00:25:36.909
His Majesty wants the Eunuch himself,

277
00:25:38.125 --> 00:25:39.818
and you brought back a pile of ashes.

278
00:25:39.892 --> 00:25:42.776
This tablet is
no evidence enough that it's him!

279
00:25:43.826 --> 00:25:46.169
You don't even convince me,
let alone His Majesty.

280
00:25:47.123 --> 00:25:48.503
Sir Han,

281
00:25:48.804 --> 00:25:50.526
what are you saying?

282
00:25:51.184 --> 00:25:52.486
You think...

283
00:25:52.543 --> 00:25:54.286
these three Imperial Assassins...

284
00:25:54.465 --> 00:25:56.756
brought back the corpse
of someone else?

285
00:25:57.161 --> 00:25:59.395
Sir, we would never dare.

286
00:26:14.201 --> 00:26:16.728
If you ask me,
this is Wei himself.

287
00:26:17.351 --> 00:26:20.877
Dozens of Assassins
saw him burning to death.

288
00:26:22.063 --> 00:26:24.121
Who would have the guts...

289
00:26:24.950 --> 00:26:27.048
to play tricks under everyone's nose?

290
00:26:27.185 --> 00:26:29.039
It would have been suicidal.

291
00:26:29.889 --> 00:26:31.526
Sir Zhao,

292
00:26:32.345 --> 00:26:34.127
His Majesty is young...

293
00:26:34.240 --> 00:26:35.809
but very shrewd.

294
00:26:35.877 --> 00:26:37.714
When you're at His service,

295
00:26:38.168 --> 00:26:39.904
better be extra careful.

296
00:26:40.375 --> 00:26:42.659
If anything goes wrong,
we all go down.

297
00:26:44.525 --> 00:26:46.964
Yes, Sir!
You're right, Sir Han.

298
00:26:48.050 --> 00:26:50.046
Thank you for standing up for us.

299
00:26:50.133 --> 00:26:51.845
We're more then grateful.

300
00:26:52.328 --> 00:26:54.460
It's fine, go get some rest.

301
00:26:55.500 --> 00:26:57.697
Good job,
I'll put in a good word for you.

302
00:26:58.686 --> 00:27:00.183
Thank you, your Excellency.

303
00:27:00.385 --> 00:27:01.876
But next time you see Sir Han,

304
00:27:02.004 --> 00:27:03.343
don't be so presumptuous.

305
00:27:03.401 --> 00:27:05.134
You know very well...

306
00:27:05.285 --> 00:27:07.487
whether you really saw Wei or not.

307
00:27:08.035 --> 00:27:09.623
<i>Let's go.</i>

308
00:27:17.404 --> 00:27:19.120
Your lungs are straining.

309
00:27:19.194 --> 00:27:20.648
There's blood in your phlegm.

310
00:27:21.309 --> 00:27:24.218
Your skin is dry and your pulse is weak.

311
00:27:25.004 --> 00:27:26.268
Master Jin...

312
00:27:26.324 --> 00:27:27.916
how is your sleep?

313
00:27:36.525 --> 00:27:38.660
Master Jin...
- What?

314
00:27:39.469 --> 00:27:41.452
I'm asking about your sleep.

315
00:27:42.553 --> 00:27:44.531
I sweat a lot.
- I thought so.

316
00:27:45.468 --> 00:27:46.983
Just a second, Master Jin.

317
00:27:47.105 --> 00:27:48.625
I'll write you a prescription.

318
00:28:00.033 --> 00:28:01.816
My name is Jin.
Jin Ychuan.

319
00:28:02.990 --> 00:28:04.220
I know that.

320
00:28:04.274 --> 00:28:06.370
Sweetie,
if you're done with all the work...

321
00:28:06.460 --> 00:28:08.034
come back in here.

322
00:28:08.805 --> 00:28:10.130
Okay.

323
00:28:19.661 --> 00:28:21.718
What is this?
- Musk, cloves, sandalwood...

324
00:28:21.807 --> 00:28:23.217
and borneol wrapped together.

325
00:28:23.278 --> 00:28:24.851
Keep it on you.

326
00:28:25.159 --> 00:28:27.048
It will help with your cough.

327
00:28:30.006 --> 00:28:32.165
Thank you.
- My name is Zhang Yan.

328
00:28:32.414 --> 00:28:33.857
Don't tell my father.

329
00:28:33.920 --> 00:28:36.387
He doesn't like it when I write
my own prescriptions.

330
00:28:37.293 --> 00:28:39.190
Yichuan...
- Okay!

331
00:29:17.753 --> 00:29:20.000
Wei Ting, you've got some nerve.

332
00:29:20.323 --> 00:29:22.472
The entire country is hunting down
members of the Clique,

333
00:29:22.581 --> 00:29:24.765
and you dare return to the Capital.

334
00:29:25.160 --> 00:29:26.636
Jingzhong,

335
00:29:26.816 --> 00:29:29.625
look at how you veil your accusations.

336
00:29:31.360 --> 00:29:33.472
I see you've grown subtle.

337
00:29:36.399 --> 00:29:38.037
Godfather...

338
00:29:38.309 --> 00:29:40.024
you're unharmed!

339
00:29:40.193 --> 00:29:41.894
I'm not dead,

340
00:29:42.408 --> 00:29:44.865
and yet you don't seem surprised.

341
00:29:45.297 --> 00:29:48.288
When I saw the corpse,
I knew it wasn't you.

342
00:29:49.196 --> 00:29:50.727
So of course I'm not surprised.

343
00:29:56.695 --> 00:29:58.603
How are things at the Secret Police?

344
00:29:59.274 --> 00:30:00.903
His Majesty is having all documents...

345
00:30:01.118 --> 00:30:02.891
at the Secret Service examined.

346
00:30:03.885 --> 00:30:07.302
I think...
he plans to close it up.

347
00:30:08.813 --> 00:30:12.093
The Secret Police
has existed for almost 200 years.

348
00:30:13.087 --> 00:30:15.151
I didn't think it would end with my reign.

349
00:30:20.019 --> 00:30:22.972
You're heading the Secret Police now,
aren't you?

350
00:30:23.795 --> 00:30:25.324
You know everything.

351
00:30:25.711 --> 00:30:27.743
His Majesty...
just appointed me.

352
00:30:29.303 --> 00:30:31.098
Special passes.
- Yes.

353
00:30:31.764 --> 00:30:33.709
You would need them on your way.

354
00:30:34.631 --> 00:30:36.528
You want to get rid of me.

355
00:30:37.066 --> 00:30:38.537
That's not what I meant!

356
00:30:47.088 --> 00:30:50.039
You recognized that corpse,
didn't you?

357
00:30:51.090 --> 00:30:52.827
It was my servant.

358
00:30:53.072 --> 00:30:54.576
Ting found out that...

359
00:30:54.777 --> 00:30:56.502
his family name was also Zhao,

360
00:30:56.840 --> 00:30:58.589
and that you're from the same town.

361
00:31:00.751 --> 00:31:02.337
Godfather...

362
00:31:03.445 --> 00:31:05.308
your men are no match for me.

363
00:31:05.389 --> 00:31:07.063
If a fight starts...

364
00:31:07.313 --> 00:31:09.091
we both lose.

365
00:31:17.298 --> 00:31:19.201
Don't you want to kill me?

366
00:31:21.301 --> 00:31:23.350
I thought you'd be more reckless.

367
00:31:29.894 --> 00:31:31.395
My son...

368
00:31:32.897 --> 00:31:34.495
you want to kill me...

369
00:31:36.349 --> 00:31:38.338
because you don't want to get
dragged into this.

370
00:31:38.994 --> 00:31:40.527
Am I right?

371
00:31:44.719 --> 00:31:46.942
That Imperial Assassin knows I'm alive.

372
00:31:47.175 --> 00:31:48.940
Kill him for me.

373
00:31:51.444 --> 00:31:52.764
Godfather...

374
00:31:52.821 --> 00:31:55.569
that Han Kuang is already suspicious.
If we act now...

375
00:31:57.299 --> 00:31:59.150
I'm afraid he'll leave no stone unturned.

376
00:31:59.230 --> 00:32:01.088
Kill Shen Lian,

377
00:32:03.023 --> 00:32:05.058
and I'll disappear.

378
00:32:08.226 --> 00:32:09.835
Only then,

379
00:32:10.761 --> 00:32:12.856
will you be truly safe.

380
00:32:39.751 --> 00:32:41.700
Miaotong...

381
00:32:42.721 --> 00:32:44.354
with this money...

382
00:32:46.082 --> 00:32:47.680
I can buy your freedom.

383
00:32:48.632 --> 00:32:50.245
We'll go to Suzhou,

384
00:32:52.090 --> 00:32:54.165
and you can have whatever you like.

385
00:32:56.011 --> 00:32:57.496
What do you say?

386
00:33:07.074 --> 00:33:08.960
<i>Miaotong... hurry.</i>

387
00:33:09.145 --> 00:33:10.916
<i>Sir Shen has been waiting down there.</i>

388
00:33:11.753 --> 00:33:14.166
Madame, please offer him a few more drinks.

389
00:33:14.270 --> 00:33:15.686
My treat.

390
00:33:17.930 --> 00:33:19.362
Miaotong...

391
00:33:20.887 --> 00:33:22.520
Why are you still here?

392
00:33:23.967 --> 00:33:26.136
I have... a visitor.

393
00:33:28.491 --> 00:33:29.963
I can't bear to leave you.

394
00:33:31.022 --> 00:33:33.289
Whatever visitor that is,
I'll ask him to leave.

395
00:33:34.345 --> 00:33:37.146
That won't do,
he's an Imperial Assassin.

396
00:33:37.267 --> 00:33:39.110
I hate their bunch...

397
00:33:39.666 --> 00:33:41.944
wearing Spring Blades bestowed
by His Majesty,

398
00:33:42.329 --> 00:33:44.465
but always with innocent blood
on their hands.

399
00:33:45.928 --> 00:33:47.513
<i>This one's different.</i>

400
00:33:47.807 --> 00:33:49.611
<i>He says he will...</i>

401
00:33:49.778 --> 00:33:51.624
<i>buy me freedom.</i>

402
00:33:53.019 --> 00:33:55.343
You care about him.
- No, silly.

403
00:33:56.249 --> 00:33:57.949
I'm not taking his money.

404
00:33:59.490 --> 00:34:01.128
I only wish...

405
00:34:01.222 --> 00:34:03.086
it was you who bought me freedom.

406
00:34:03.728 --> 00:34:05.524
<i>Miaotong, I've almost saved enough...</i>

407
00:34:05.602 --> 00:34:07.843
to take you away from here very soon.

408
00:34:08.253 --> 00:34:10.001
We'll go somewhere beautiful...

409
00:34:10.158 --> 00:34:11.688
and spend our life there.

410
00:34:38.282 --> 00:34:40.098
You two are really too much.

411
00:34:40.385 --> 00:34:41.909
Why are you still here?

412
00:34:42.194 --> 00:34:44.455
Madame Xue,
I did pay you for this.

413
00:34:44.895 --> 00:34:46.547
But...

414
00:34:46.826 --> 00:34:48.436
Alright.

415
00:34:48.599 --> 00:34:50.180
You should go.

416
00:34:56.555 --> 00:34:58.519
Miaotong, Sir Shen is gone!

417
00:35:02.761 --> 00:35:06.666
<i>Miaotong, Sir Shen must never find
out about you and young Master Yan.</i>

418
00:35:07.427 --> 00:35:09.143
<i>You don't want to displease...</i>

419
00:35:09.289 --> 00:35:11.328
<i>an Imperial Assassin.</i>

420
00:35:18.921 --> 00:35:20.719
Yichuan, try it on.

421
00:35:26.492 --> 00:35:28.132
Thank you.

422
00:35:30.079 --> 00:35:31.729
Lian is here.

423
00:35:33.597 --> 00:35:35.353
Lian.

424
00:35:36.515 --> 00:35:38.560
Bottoms up.
- Cheers.

425
00:35:41.538 --> 00:35:43.832
Did you go see Miss Zhou?

426
00:35:52.139 --> 00:35:54.365
Yichuan, that pretty thing you
have on your belt,

427
00:35:54.886 --> 00:35:56.517
where did you get it?

428
00:35:56.660 --> 00:35:58.445
Come on, Lian.

429
00:35:59.143 --> 00:36:01.802
You were there, weren't you?

430
00:36:02.485 --> 00:36:04.197
You little bastard, tell me.

431
00:36:04.416 --> 00:36:06.098
Do you fancy the doctor's daughter?

432
00:36:06.171 --> 00:36:07.709
You went to see the doctor?

433
00:36:07.799 --> 00:36:09.267
What for?

434
00:36:28.723 --> 00:36:30.245
Watch out!

435
00:36:40.908 --> 00:36:42.243
Who were they?

436
00:36:43.333 --> 00:36:44.577
Hard to tell.

437
00:36:44.879 --> 00:36:46.342
Even on our way back here...

438
00:36:46.405 --> 00:36:47.845
we were being followed.

439
00:36:47.984 --> 00:36:49.536
We should all watch out.

440
00:36:49.603 --> 00:36:52.525
Maybe someone from the Clique
wants to avenge Wei.

441
00:36:54.680 --> 00:36:57.378
If so...
we can't stay in the capital.

442
00:36:58.393 --> 00:37:00.460
They see us but we don't see them.

443
00:37:00.613 --> 00:37:03.431
Jianxing,
why don't we ask our superior...

444
00:37:03.804 --> 00:37:05.958
to transfer us to Nanjing?

445
00:37:07.807 --> 00:37:09.431
Nanjing?

446
00:37:10.139 --> 00:37:12.457
Lian, I've never seen you scared.

447
00:37:13.627 --> 00:37:15.398
What's wrong this time?

448
00:37:16.018 --> 00:37:17.474
Jianxing,

449
00:37:17.706 --> 00:37:20.059
for once, listen to me.
Alright?

450
00:37:21.316 --> 00:37:22.899
Wei Zhongxian...

451
00:37:23.457 --> 00:37:25.199
set himself on fire?
- Yes.

452
00:37:25.407 --> 00:37:26.859
He set himself on fire.

453
00:37:28.133 --> 00:37:29.573
If you leave...

454
00:37:29.772 --> 00:37:31.357
what about Miss Zhou?

455
00:37:31.426 --> 00:37:33.217
I'll find a way to bring her along.

456
00:37:35.388 --> 00:37:36.749
You know very well...

457
00:37:36.981 --> 00:37:38.629
whether you saw Wei or not.

458
00:37:40.187 --> 00:37:41.597
I say...

459
00:37:41.681 --> 00:37:43.628
let's stay put,
and see how it goes.

460
00:37:43.769 --> 00:37:45.427
What do you think?

461
00:37:46.953 --> 00:37:48.961
I'll do whatever you two decide.
- Good.

462
00:37:49.197 --> 00:37:50.991
Jianxing...
- Stop it.

463
00:38:14.782 --> 00:38:16.580
I told you not to act on your own!

464
00:38:17.413 --> 00:38:18.780
If it weren't for me...

465
00:38:18.957 --> 00:38:20.494
they would have caught you.

466
00:38:21.209 --> 00:38:22.934
Don't expect me to be grateful.

467
00:38:23.556 --> 00:38:24.875
Godfather told you...

468
00:38:24.955 --> 00:38:26.833
to do it as soon as possible.

469
00:38:33.284 --> 00:38:35.092
I have my plans.

470
00:38:37.389 --> 00:38:39.333
Do you know about Yan Peiwei?

471
00:38:39.507 --> 00:38:41.720
He's the Commander
of the Imperial Court of Censors.

472
00:38:42.550 --> 00:38:44.095
Correct!

473
00:38:44.391 --> 00:38:46.372
He's also a member of the Golden Swords.

474
00:38:46.479 --> 00:38:48.669
Imperial Assassins...
today...

475
00:38:48.988 --> 00:38:50.806
you are to arrest members of the
Clique listed here!

476
00:38:50.885 --> 00:38:52.867
He commands several dozen followers,

477
00:38:53.002 --> 00:38:54.954
all highly skilled fighters.

478
00:38:55.830 --> 00:38:57.749
Lui Jianxing!
- Yes, Sir.

479
00:38:57.832 --> 00:38:59.639
Shen Lian!
- Yes, Sir.

480
00:38:59.821 --> 00:39:01.373
You two come with me.

481
00:39:01.629 --> 00:39:03.888
We're going to Yan Peiwei's residence.

482
00:39:05.724 --> 00:39:07.447
When you kill,

483
00:39:09.290 --> 00:39:11.444
it's essential not to leave any traces.

484
00:39:15.942 --> 00:39:17.653
Commander, we have been waiting
a long time.

485
00:39:17.728 --> 00:39:19.104
Shall we force our way in?

486
00:39:19.618 --> 00:39:21.521
We're coming for Yan Peiwei alone.

487
00:39:21.930 --> 00:39:24.348
Why storm the residence?
Is it a massacre you want?

488
00:39:26.988 --> 00:39:28.837
Any volunteers to go get him?

489
00:39:29.618 --> 00:39:30.917
Jianxing...

490
00:39:31.345 --> 00:39:32.776
something is not right!

491
00:39:33.413 --> 00:39:34.789
Don't go!

492
00:39:35.342 --> 00:39:36.833
What are you scared of?

493
00:39:37.642 --> 00:39:40.708
Are the Golden Swords that scary?

494
00:39:41.595 --> 00:39:42.912
Who would have the guts...

495
00:39:42.969 --> 00:39:44.470
to resist Imperial Assassins?

496
00:39:44.647 --> 00:39:46.184
I have orders.

497
00:39:46.576 --> 00:39:48.340
Whoever captures Yan Peiwei...

498
00:39:49.141 --> 00:39:50.794
will be promoted.

499
00:39:56.113 --> 00:39:57.654
Lui Jianxing...

500
00:40:00.537 --> 00:40:01.769
wouldn't you...

501
00:40:01.823 --> 00:40:03.408
like this credit?

502
00:40:10.679 --> 00:40:12.228
You two don't have to go.

503
00:40:12.446 --> 00:40:14.038
I'll go by myself.

504
00:40:29.830 --> 00:40:31.657
Sir, how can I help you?

505
00:40:32.310 --> 00:40:34.151
I am Garrison Officer Lui Jianxing.

506
00:40:34.337 --> 00:40:35.934
I'm here to see Sir Yan.

507
00:40:36.030 --> 00:40:37.982
I am Yan Junbin, son of Yan Peiwei.

508
00:40:38.633 --> 00:40:40.312
My father is not well,

509
00:40:40.472 --> 00:40:42.102
and does not want to receive visitors.

510
00:40:42.173 --> 00:40:46.356
I have Division orders,
to bring Sir Yan in for questioning.

511
00:40:47.179 --> 00:40:48.785
This is the mandate.

512
00:40:49.126 --> 00:40:51.584
Young Master Yan,
it's better to let me in...

513
00:40:52.052 --> 00:40:54.925
instead of having the Baihu Commander
killing his way in!

514
00:40:55.424 --> 00:40:56.978
What do you say?

515
00:41:00.437 --> 00:41:03.420
Alright...
please follow me.

516
00:41:24.070 --> 00:41:25.464
Having Imperial Assassins here...

517
00:41:25.525 --> 00:41:26.802
makes them nervous!

518
00:41:26.857 --> 00:41:28.423
Please don't be offended.

519
00:41:32.840 --> 00:41:34.544
Father...

520
00:41:42.214 --> 00:41:43.873
Junbin, what are you doing?

521
00:41:43.945 --> 00:41:45.658
Father, I read the mandate.

522
00:41:45.733 --> 00:41:47.191
They're framing you to be
a member of the Clique.

523
00:41:47.254 --> 00:41:48.361
So what?

524
00:41:48.410 --> 00:41:50.054
Even if I have to go to the highest court,

525
00:41:50.125 --> 00:41:51.351
I'm still innocent.

526
00:41:51.404 --> 00:41:52.712
What do I have to be scared of?

527
00:41:52.789 --> 00:41:55.140
Once you're in the Imperial Prison,
they will torture a confession out of you.

528
00:41:55.242 --> 00:41:57.076
Why don't we tie up these Assassins...

529
00:41:57.155 --> 00:41:59.096
and make a run for it?
- Shut up!

530
00:41:59.986 --> 00:42:02.069
What you suggest is rebellion!
- Father!

531
00:42:02.713 --> 00:42:05.764
Sir Yan, we know you're not
a member of the Clique.

532
00:42:06.197 --> 00:42:07.903
It must be some kind of misunderstanding.

533
00:42:07.977 --> 00:42:10.171
I'm sure the judges will clear your name.

534
00:42:10.707 --> 00:42:12.285
I do hope that...

535
00:42:12.709 --> 00:42:14.320
you can come with us.

536
00:42:14.781 --> 00:42:17.563
I'll come with you, but can you...

537
00:42:17.683 --> 00:42:19.743
leave my family alone?
- Father!

538
00:42:20.908 --> 00:42:22.485
By all means.

539
00:42:24.595 --> 00:42:26.012
I won't be long.

540
00:42:28.450 --> 00:42:29.792
Father!

541
00:42:32.124 --> 00:42:33.463
Father!

542
00:42:37.775 --> 00:42:39.114
Kill them!

543
00:42:45.061 --> 00:42:46.554
Send the signal!

544
00:42:50.541 --> 00:42:53.491
Commander, the fight seems to
have started. Are we going in?

545
00:42:58.996 --> 00:43:00.855
Are you telling me what to do?

546
00:43:01.527 --> 00:43:02.620
I would never.

547
00:43:03.857 --> 00:43:06.198
No one goes in!
Seal off the gate.

548
00:43:06.299 --> 00:43:08.287
Don't let any Clique member get out!

549
00:43:09.413 --> 00:43:11.056
Wait till it dies down inside.

550
00:43:18.702 --> 00:43:19.989
Open the gate!

551
00:43:26.341 --> 00:43:27.944
Friends!
Open the gate!

552
00:43:38.175 --> 00:43:39.892
Jianxing, the gate is sealed!

553
00:43:47.112 --> 00:43:48.463
Everybody, stop!

554
00:44:11.210 --> 00:44:12.573
Lian!

555
00:44:14.961 --> 00:44:16.270
Jianxing!

556
00:44:22.263 --> 00:44:23.529
Yichuan...
- I'm here!

557
00:44:23.673 --> 00:44:25.819
Lian... - I'm here to!
- Let's finish this!

558
00:44:26.086 --> 00:44:27.805
And go get drunk.

559
00:44:30.616 --> 00:44:31.942
Arrows!

560
00:44:52.295 --> 00:44:53.595
Arrows!

561
00:44:59.062 --> 00:45:00.500
Your tea, Your Excellency.

562
00:45:04.004 --> 00:45:06.145
One Two... One Two...

563
00:46:20.294 --> 00:46:21.693
Yichuan...

564
00:46:33.110 --> 00:46:34.524
What exactly...

565
00:46:36.746 --> 00:46:38.290
did we do?

566
00:46:56.526 --> 00:46:58.017
Why are there no sounds?

567
00:46:58.242 --> 00:46:59.555
Open the gate!

568
00:47:36.424 --> 00:47:39.200
Your Excellency...
the three of them are coming out!

569
00:48:11.887 --> 00:48:13.645
Shit... Goddamned!

570
00:48:23.657 --> 00:48:24.991
Who is it?

571
00:48:27.058 --> 00:48:28.497
Who's there?

572
00:48:45.204 --> 00:48:46.595
Officer Shen,

573
00:48:46.784 --> 00:48:48.475
are you trying to scare me to death?

574
00:48:49.197 --> 00:48:50.637
I wouldn't dare!

575
00:48:52.035 --> 00:48:54.418
Especially...
after I almost died myself.

576
00:48:57.242 --> 00:48:58.590
It wasn't me!

577
00:48:59.356 --> 00:49:01.205
I didn't order for the gate to be sealed!

578
00:49:01.819 --> 00:49:03.739
I don't know which bastard gave the order!

579
00:49:04.515 --> 00:49:06.377
I told them...
to open the gate.

580
00:49:07.704 --> 00:49:09.786
Please, it wasn't me!
- I understand.

581
00:49:10.656 --> 00:49:12.006
The three of us...

582
00:49:12.065 --> 00:49:13.584
took care of Wei Zhongxian.

583
00:49:14.025 --> 00:49:16.312
Obviously, the Clique wants us dead.

584
00:49:18.167 --> 00:49:20.403
We can't stay in Beijing anymore.

585
00:49:21.480 --> 00:49:23.065
Please...

586
00:49:23.733 --> 00:49:26.339
transfer us to Nanjing.

587
00:49:34.771 --> 00:49:36.308
300 taels...

588
00:49:37.539 --> 00:49:38.994
Sure thing.

589
00:49:39.353 --> 00:49:40.930
Once in Nanjing,

590
00:49:41.146 --> 00:49:43.505
Jianxing would be promoted,
I presume.

591
00:49:43.804 --> 00:49:45.279
Sure.

592
00:49:47.766 --> 00:49:49.095
Shen Lian,

593
00:49:49.927 --> 00:49:51.717
let's put this thing...

594
00:49:52.659 --> 00:49:54.168
behind us.

595
00:49:56.636 --> 00:49:57.920
Shall we?

596
00:50:12.577 --> 00:50:15.397
Sir Shen...
my master asked me to deliver this.

597
00:50:41.699 --> 00:50:43.187
Father, have some tea.

598
00:50:44.745 --> 00:50:46.482
Sir Jin, have some tea.

599
00:51:20.865 --> 00:51:22.733
It's time.
I want the money.

600
00:51:24.686 --> 00:51:27.345
A petty criminal killing an
Imperial Assassin...

601
00:51:27.459 --> 00:51:29.323
and stealing his identity...

602
00:51:29.507 --> 00:51:31.059
I'm sure...

603
00:51:31.230 --> 00:51:34.204
the police would be interested
in that story.

604
00:51:41.532 --> 00:51:42.928
100 taels...

605
00:51:46.193 --> 00:51:47.931
And leave Ynchuan alone!

606
00:51:48.667 --> 00:51:50.381
Take the money and get lost.

607
00:51:50.950 --> 00:51:52.850
Didn't expect
Sir Shen to be so well off.

608
00:51:54.337 --> 00:51:57.231
Ding Xiu,
I did my homework on you.

609
00:51:57.605 --> 00:51:59.230
You're an excellent swordsman,

610
00:51:59.336 --> 00:52:01.354
but you're no match
for an Imperial Assassin.

611
00:52:14.654 --> 00:52:15.977
Thanks.

612
00:52:23.014 --> 00:52:25.026
So you knew all along?
- Yichuan...

613
00:52:25.357 --> 00:52:27.032
we're like brothers.

614
00:52:27.312 --> 00:52:28.929
I won't ask you about Ding Xiu.

615
00:52:29.067 --> 00:52:30.438
In return...

616
00:52:30.599 --> 00:52:32.040
please don't ask me...

617
00:52:32.172 --> 00:52:33.592
about the money.

618
00:52:34.162 --> 00:52:36.155
Deal?
- Sure.

619
00:52:39.065 --> 00:52:41.416
Jianxing...
Sir Han is throwing a dinner party.

620
00:52:41.518 --> 00:52:43.044
We're all invited.

621
00:52:47.697 --> 00:52:50.133
<i>Lian,
you're hiding something from me.</i>

622
00:52:50.808 --> 00:52:52.446
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

623
00:52:53.175 --> 00:52:54.804
<i>Ever since we came back here...</i>

624
00:52:54.910 --> 00:52:56.742
<i>I know something is not right.</i>

625
00:52:57.264 --> 00:53:00.387
<i>I've been wondering,
that night at the inn...</i>

626
00:53:01.267 --> 00:53:02.917
<i>what really happened?</i>

627
00:53:03.720 --> 00:53:06.600
<i>Jianxing...
I never betrayed you...</i>

628
00:53:06.724 --> 00:53:08.247
<i>or Yichuan in any way.</i>

629
00:53:09.346 --> 00:53:10.797
<i>My conscience is clear.</i>

630
00:53:11.091 --> 00:53:12.431
<i>I trust you.</i>

631
00:53:20.673 --> 00:53:22.957
Sir Han is here!

632
00:53:25.073 --> 00:53:28.074
Sir Han... Sir Zhao.

633
00:53:29.044 --> 00:53:31.598
Please sit down.
- Thank you.

634
00:53:35.055 --> 00:53:38.262
Officer Liu.
- Your Excellency.

635
00:53:39.277 --> 00:53:41.046
Why are you hiding in the corner?
Come.

636
00:53:41.198 --> 00:53:42.533
Sit here.

637
00:53:43.138 --> 00:53:45.301
Your Excellency,
I'm just a lowly officer.

638
00:53:45.937 --> 00:53:48.893
I don't deserve to share
a table with you and Sir Zhao.

639
00:53:49.539 --> 00:53:50.807
Nonsense.

640
00:53:51.267 --> 00:53:53.279
It's your big day today.

641
00:53:53.855 --> 00:53:55.239
You should sit here.

642
00:53:55.568 --> 00:53:57.802
What big day?
I don't understand.

643
00:53:58.620 --> 00:54:00.816
Officer Liu
carried out His Majesty's orders...

644
00:54:00.977 --> 00:54:02.718
and killed Wei Zhongxian.

645
00:54:03.042 --> 00:54:04.593
That's his first feat.

646
00:54:04.892 --> 00:54:07.935
Today he came out unscathed from
the Yan residence,

647
00:54:08.348 --> 00:54:10.684
and captured Yan Peiwei's son alive.

648
00:54:11.008 --> 00:54:12.636
That's his second feat.

649
00:54:13.763 --> 00:54:15.927
Sir Zhenfu Commander,
what were you saying just now?

650
00:54:16.636 --> 00:54:17.899
Your Excellency,

651
00:54:17.954 --> 00:54:19.538
Officer Lui should be promoted...

652
00:54:19.610 --> 00:54:21.375
to Baihu Commander.

653
00:54:23.497 --> 00:54:24.883
Bring it over.

654
00:54:27.592 --> 00:54:29.464
Congratulations, Sir Lui.

655
00:54:30.287 --> 00:54:33.268
Tomorrow you'll be a level 6 officer
of the Imperial Court.

656
00:54:33.916 --> 00:54:35.854
You are of course qualified
for this table.

657
00:54:37.965 --> 00:54:40.413
As you say, Your Excellency.

658
00:54:41.717 --> 00:54:43.621
There was a funny story actually.

659
00:54:44.304 --> 00:54:46.010
Sir Lui was so impatient that...

660
00:54:46.186 --> 00:54:48.790
he gave Zhang Ying 300 taels...

661
00:54:48.902 --> 00:54:50.485
to bribe the right people.

662
00:54:50.554 --> 00:54:52.294
It was completely unnecessary.

663
00:55:03.444 --> 00:55:04.872
Sir Lui...

664
00:55:19.835 --> 00:55:21.333
Please don't be offended.

665
00:55:22.680 --> 00:55:24.325
There are only good friends here tonight.

666
00:55:24.519 --> 00:55:26.493
Don't be embarrassed.
- Yes.

667
00:55:26.965 --> 00:55:28.593
And don't go to Nanjing.

668
00:55:29.029 --> 00:55:30.868
The Imperial Court needs people like you.

669
00:55:31.115 --> 00:55:33.446
The three of you,
are better off here.

670
00:55:34.564 --> 00:55:35.917
Nanjing?

671
00:55:36.093 --> 00:55:38.254
Zhang Ying said you asked to be
transferred to Nanjing.

672
00:55:43.648 --> 00:55:45.734
The food I serve is plain,

673
00:55:46.261 --> 00:55:48.659
so I'm showing a performance...

674
00:55:49.008 --> 00:55:50.758
to add a little flavor.

675
00:56:14.795 --> 00:56:16.226
By the way, Sir Lui...

676
00:56:16.288 --> 00:56:18.051
where did you get the 300 taels...

677
00:56:18.196 --> 00:56:19.622
for bribery?

678
00:56:28.965 --> 00:56:30.354
Sir Lui,

679
00:56:30.534 --> 00:56:32.206
you killed Wei Zhongxian,

680
00:56:32.778 --> 00:56:34.665
and brought back tons of
his treasures.

681
00:56:36.135 --> 00:56:38.239
Sometimes Imperial Assassins...

682
00:56:38.433 --> 00:56:39.925
keep a little pocket money.

683
00:56:40.093 --> 00:56:42.121
I completely understand.

684
00:56:43.556 --> 00:56:45.344
What I'm saying is...

685
00:56:45.851 --> 00:56:47.753
you didn't need to spend that money.

686
00:56:48.211 --> 00:56:49.824
The position...

687
00:56:50.220 --> 00:56:51.944
would be yours anyway.

688
00:56:57.835 --> 00:56:59.738
In three days we'll perform an autopsy.

689
00:57:00.960 --> 00:57:02.909
If we prove the body is really Wei's,

690
00:57:03.827 --> 00:57:05.746
His Majesty will announce to the world...

691
00:57:05.932 --> 00:57:08.993
that...
the Clique has fallen.

692
00:57:11.335 --> 00:57:14.555
And now...
let's drink up.

693
00:57:31.116 --> 00:57:32.699
Sir...

694
00:57:35.935 --> 00:57:37.874
with the condition it's in...

695
00:57:38.187 --> 00:57:40.252
it's still possible to examine the body?

696
00:57:43.679 --> 00:57:45.573
Wei drank elixir for so many years...

697
00:57:45.831 --> 00:57:47.759
that we can still find it in his bones.

698
00:57:47.843 --> 00:57:50.713
This inspection is merely a formality.

699
00:57:54.225 --> 00:57:55.841
No need to worry.

700
00:57:57.030 --> 00:57:58.435
You're right.

701
00:58:02.160 --> 00:58:03.751
Sir Lui,

702
00:58:04.552 --> 00:58:06.292
you're getting promoted tomorrow,

703
00:58:06.368 --> 00:58:07.902
and yet you don't seem excited.

704
00:58:08.648 --> 00:58:10.250
Anything on your mind?

705
00:58:13.077 --> 00:58:14.457
No... No.

706
00:58:14.912 --> 00:58:16.558
I'm rather flattered.

707
00:58:18.161 --> 00:58:19.391
Good.

708
00:58:42.989 --> 00:58:44.586
What are you exactly,

709
00:58:44.733 --> 00:58:46.286
a good guy or a bad guy?

710
00:58:46.353 --> 00:58:47.946
I did it to stay alive.

711
00:58:48.795 --> 00:58:50.599
What would you have done?

712
00:58:55.238 --> 00:58:56.721
I know...

713
00:58:56.785 --> 00:58:58.882
you guys made a fortune.

714
00:58:59.406 --> 00:59:00.878
Give me half the money.

715
00:59:01.117 --> 00:59:03.971
Otherwise...
I'll perform your story...

716
00:59:04.287 --> 00:59:07.480
every day in front of the Division office.

717
00:59:12.984 --> 00:59:14.407
Xiu...

718
00:59:14.621 --> 00:59:15.977
what fortune?

719
00:59:16.597 --> 00:59:18.225
There's no such thing.

720
00:59:24.456 --> 00:59:25.850
Sir Zhao.

721
00:59:27.088 --> 00:59:28.515
You know who I am?

722
00:59:28.577 --> 00:59:31.177
Who doesn't in this town?

723
00:59:55.730 --> 00:59:57.073
Not bad.

724
00:59:58.741 --> 00:59:59.970
Your Excellency...

725
01:00:00.024 --> 01:00:01.936
this flute is a family heirloom.

726
01:00:11.024 --> 01:00:12.620
May I be excused?

727
01:00:25.866 --> 01:00:27.465
Jianxing.

728
01:00:32.467 --> 01:00:35.427
There's something that I've been...
- Jianxing!

729
01:00:36.836 --> 01:00:38.353
Tell me...
- Jianxing, stop it!

730
01:00:38.419 --> 01:00:40.151
Why did you have to buy me a promotion?

731
01:00:40.226 --> 01:00:42.065
Where did you get the silver?

732
01:00:43.319 --> 01:00:45.626
Tell me...
- You are my sworn brother,

733
01:00:46.002 --> 01:00:47.720
and you set me up like this?

734
01:00:47.794 --> 01:00:49.176
Tell me! Tell me!

735
01:00:49.762 --> 01:00:51.026
Jianxing, stop it!

736
01:00:51.081 --> 01:00:53.461
Lian, tell him the truth!
- Go away!

737
01:01:02.125 --> 01:01:05.604
Yichuan... are you alright?

738
01:01:06.529 --> 01:01:08.208
Yichuan.
- I'm fine.

739
01:01:21.971 --> 01:01:24.262
Wei Zhongxian is not dead!

740
01:01:27.218 --> 01:01:28.553
What?

741
01:01:35.048 --> 01:01:36.694
Every penny he gave me is here.

742
01:01:39.298 --> 01:01:40.713
That's for Jianxing.

743
01:01:42.363 --> 01:01:43.782
That's for Yichuan.

744
01:01:45.131 --> 01:01:46.394
And that's for Miaotong.

745
01:01:47.090 --> 01:01:48.516
I didn't think...

746
01:01:48.666 --> 01:01:50.373
it would turn out this way.

747
01:01:50.748 --> 01:01:52.185
In that case,

748
01:01:52.271 --> 01:01:53.778
we were in so many trouble...

749
01:01:53.892 --> 01:01:55.939
because Wei Zhongxian wants to kill us.

750
01:01:57.062 --> 01:01:58.517
I'd like to borrow...

751
01:01:58.664 --> 01:02:00.387
some of your guards,
if I may be so bold.

752
01:02:00.462 --> 01:02:02.590
Zhao Jingzhong,
you already screwed it up.

753
01:02:03.043 --> 01:02:04.843
How dare you ask for Godfather's guards!

754
01:02:08.611 --> 01:02:10.174
Jianxing, Lian...

755
01:02:11.207 --> 01:02:13.549
Sir Zhao is very likely the man in
black last night.

756
01:02:15.443 --> 01:02:17.378
Han Kuang is performing an autopsy
in three days.

757
01:02:18.749 --> 01:02:20.869
Those three have to be gone by the
day after tomorrow.

758
01:02:24.159 --> 01:02:26.388
Yichuan...
don't say that unless you're sure.

759
01:02:26.484 --> 01:02:27.984
I saw the arrow wound on his hand.

760
01:02:28.441 --> 01:02:29.987
Lian's crossbow arrow...

761
01:02:30.054 --> 01:02:31.863
is different from anyone else's.

762
01:02:32.251 --> 01:02:34.724
I saw the shape
of Sir Zhao's wound clearly.

763
01:02:38.607 --> 01:02:39.991
Godfather,

764
01:02:40.402 --> 01:02:43.086
within 24 hours,
I will have their heads for you.

765
01:02:45.456 --> 01:02:46.910
Jingzhong,

766
01:02:47.237 --> 01:02:49.644
you didn't expose yourself to them,

767
01:02:50.614 --> 01:02:52.014
did you?

768
01:02:56.127 --> 01:02:57.984
Leave the country with me.

769
01:02:59.278 --> 01:03:00.531
There is...

770
01:03:00.586 --> 01:03:02.309
no place for you in the Capital anymore.

771
01:03:10.278 --> 01:03:12.042
Reluctant, aren't you?

772
01:03:14.238 --> 01:03:15.728
Yichuan,

773
01:03:15.793 --> 01:03:17.901
tie me up and take me to
the authority.

774
01:03:20.164 --> 01:03:21.699
It was my fault.

775
01:03:23.132 --> 01:03:25.147
I can't get you two involved.

776
01:03:27.081 --> 01:03:28.553
The doctor's daughter is very nice.

777
01:03:28.873 --> 01:03:30.365
Treat her with care.

778
01:03:31.107 --> 01:03:33.185
Those who rely on their luck...

779
01:03:33.816 --> 01:03:35.560
are gamblers,

780
01:03:36.356 --> 01:03:37.840
and you...

781
01:03:39.293 --> 01:03:41.459
won't make a very good one.

782
01:03:44.384 --> 01:03:45.959
Godfather...

783
01:03:50.751 --> 01:03:52.666
I am ready to try my luck.

784
01:04:05.737 --> 01:04:07.141
Jianxing,

785
01:04:10.145 --> 01:04:12.129
I only ask you to do one last
thing for me.

786
01:04:12.412 --> 01:04:13.955
Buy Miaotong's freedom.

787
01:04:17.166 --> 01:04:18.546
Let's go!

788
01:04:18.855 --> 01:04:20.478
Let's leave town together.

789
01:04:25.634 --> 01:04:27.224
Nobody needs to die.

790
01:04:27.510 --> 01:04:29.834
We'll live peacefully...
somewhere else.

791
01:04:33.488 --> 01:04:35.497
Yichuan, go pack your things.

792
01:04:36.216 --> 01:04:38.164
We'll leave separately tomorrow.

793
01:04:44.110 --> 01:04:46.214
We have to be out of town
by nightfall.

794
01:05:03.896 --> 01:05:05.187
Your Excellency.

795
01:05:05.438 --> 01:05:06.880
You're a skilled fighter.

796
01:05:07.045 --> 01:05:09.082
I want you to kill someone for me.
- 200 taels.

797
01:05:15.715 --> 01:05:17.350
Here's 100, as an advance.

798
01:05:18.084 --> 01:05:19.650
Who does Your Excellency want to kill?

799
01:05:19.718 --> 01:05:21.508
An officer of the Zhanfu Division.

800
01:05:22.110 --> 01:05:23.862
Jin Yichuan.
- Who?

801
01:05:24.255 --> 01:05:26.621
Don't you know we studied with
the same master?

802
01:05:26.723 --> 01:05:28.273
People like you...

803
01:05:29.010 --> 01:05:30.464
wouldn't care about that.

804
01:05:31.847 --> 01:05:33.174
That's not what I meant.

805
01:05:33.232 --> 01:05:37.569
That person is very dear to me,
like a brother.

806
01:05:40.379 --> 01:05:41.818
You need to pay more!

807
01:06:04.320 --> 01:06:07.910
I Monkey King,
will teach you a lesson.

808
01:06:31.672 --> 01:06:32.941
Miaotong!

809
01:06:36.899 --> 01:06:38.935
The contents need
to be changed regularly,

810
01:06:39.023 --> 01:06:40.612
or it won't work.

811
01:06:41.789 --> 01:06:43.335
Come here every three days,

812
01:06:43.489 --> 01:06:45.071
and I'll change it for you.

813
01:06:47.277 --> 01:06:49.416
I'm leaving town today.

814
01:07:16.732 --> 01:07:18.543
Are you here to see the doctor?

815
01:07:18.835 --> 01:07:21.540
My father's out visiting a patient.
- That's okay.

816
01:07:22.804 --> 01:07:24.211
I can wait.

817
01:07:25.010 --> 01:07:26.552
It's for you.

818
01:07:27.053 --> 01:07:29.262
The pardon letter from the
Ministry of Penalty!

819
01:07:29.541 --> 01:07:31.196
Where did you get this?

820
01:07:31.423 --> 01:07:33.699
I'm here today to set you free.

821
01:07:34.585 --> 01:07:36.035
I'm leaving town.

822
01:07:36.630 --> 01:07:38.043
Come with me.

823
01:07:39.574 --> 01:07:41.767
That's your condition for giving
me my freedom?

824
01:07:50.041 --> 01:07:51.611
I came here...

825
01:07:52.983 --> 01:07:54.623
to ask you a favor.

826
01:07:55.166 --> 01:07:56.920
There's an official in the name of Yan.

827
01:07:56.996 --> 01:07:58.667
His son, Yan Junbin...

828
01:07:59.499 --> 01:08:02.056
I heard is now in prison.
Can you get him out?

829
01:08:03.007 --> 01:08:04.660
Yan Junbin was captured by us.

830
01:08:05.387 --> 01:08:07.552
The three of us almost died
at their house.

831
01:08:08.213 --> 01:08:09.811
One of his hands...

832
01:08:11.533 --> 01:08:13.125
What happened to him?

833
01:08:15.575 --> 01:08:17.060
Nothing!

834
01:08:26.653 --> 01:08:28.500
I can give you money to make arrangements.

835
01:08:30.263 --> 01:08:31.844
Please get him out.

836
01:08:34.081 --> 01:08:35.812
You shouldn't squander your
money this way.

837
01:08:35.887 --> 01:08:38.051
It's my money,
I can decide what to do with it.

838
01:08:41.268 --> 01:08:42.950
I never asked you for anything.

839
01:08:44.040 --> 01:08:45.475
Just this once.

840
01:08:54.035 --> 01:08:55.606
It's the Imperial Prison.

841
01:08:59.627 --> 01:09:01.239
If you get him out...

842
01:09:02.826 --> 01:09:04.394
I'll come with you.

843
01:09:08.048 --> 01:09:09.662
When he reads this letter...

844
01:09:10.096 --> 01:09:11.624
he'll trust you.

845
01:09:14.197 --> 01:09:16.225
Lian... Lian...

846
01:09:20.013 --> 01:09:22.507
Is Miss Zhou coming with us?
- What time is it?

847
01:09:22.615 --> 01:09:24.137
Three.

848
01:09:24.644 --> 01:09:26.178
Stay with Miss Zhou.

849
01:09:27.272 --> 01:09:28.673
Where are you going?

850
01:09:28.734 --> 01:09:30.654
The gates won't be closed for
another four hours.

851
01:09:30.796 --> 01:09:32.446
I'll be back by then.

852
01:09:42.212 --> 01:09:43.655
Listen...

853
01:09:44.074 --> 01:09:45.819
I have many more bottles of drugs.

854
01:09:46.087 --> 01:09:48.719
Confess...
and you won't need to suffer anymore.

855
01:09:50.108 --> 01:09:52.666
Stop wasting your time with him.
Finish the last few bottles...

856
01:09:52.868 --> 01:09:54.528
and we can go home.

857
01:09:57.794 --> 01:09:59.854
Officer...
we have Commanders orders...

858
01:09:59.944 --> 01:10:01.749
to keep feeding him this drug.

859
01:10:02.512 --> 01:10:04.196
Take a walk.
- But...

860
01:10:04.269 --> 01:10:05.768
You didn't see me.

861
01:10:08.899 --> 01:10:11.076
Go, go, go.

862
01:10:14.934 --> 01:10:16.948
Sir Yan, I am Shen Lian...

863
01:10:17.185 --> 01:10:18.781
a friend of Miaotong's.

864
01:10:19.130 --> 01:10:21.347
She asked me to get you out of here.

865
01:10:21.966 --> 01:10:23.418
Miaotong...

866
01:10:33.466 --> 01:10:35.174
She wrote you a letter,

867
01:10:36.852 --> 01:10:38.840
and asked me to bring it to you.

868
01:10:39.597 --> 01:10:41.362
My eyes are gone.

869
01:10:42.119 --> 01:10:43.745
Sir Shen, please...

870
01:10:44.371 --> 01:10:46.032
read the letter to me.

871
01:10:46.779 --> 01:10:48.219
Will you?

872
01:10:57.284 --> 01:10:58.581
To Junbin...

873
01:10:58.638 --> 01:11:00.246
The wrongs that have been done to you...

874
01:11:00.419 --> 01:11:02.141
will be righted someday.

875
01:11:02.355 --> 01:11:03.978
Please don't give up.

876
01:11:04.624 --> 01:11:08.283
You once said that you'd take me
to a beautiful place.

877
01:11:08.847 --> 01:11:10.477
I'll be waiting for you.

878
01:11:15.680 --> 01:11:17.561
Let's get out of here.

879
01:11:21.309 --> 01:11:22.755
Lian is back.

880
01:11:28.836 --> 01:11:31.150
Are you looking for Sir Shen?
He's not here.

881
01:11:31.532 --> 01:11:33.373
I'm not looking for Sir Shen.

882
01:11:33.453 --> 01:11:36.348
A Sir asked me to deliver
something to a Sir Jin.

883
01:11:41.268 --> 01:11:43.237
Prepare my sedan.
We're going to the Imperial Hospital.

884
01:11:43.322 --> 01:11:44.689
Yes, Sir.

885
01:11:45.492 --> 01:11:47.698
Your Excellency, Sir Han has left
for the Imperial Hospital.

886
01:11:47.897 --> 01:11:49.268
Yichuan...

887
01:11:54.038 --> 01:11:55.424
There's still time.

888
01:11:56.019 --> 01:11:57.436
We can still make it!

889
01:12:23.904 --> 01:12:25.373
Gentlemen...

890
01:12:25.437 --> 01:12:27.743
I need to make a trip to the
Division office tonight.

891
01:12:28.149 --> 01:12:30.236
Would you care to join me?

892
01:12:31.152 --> 01:12:34.278
Sir Baihu, why do you need
to go there tonight?

893
01:12:36.042 --> 01:12:37.493
To take my punishment.

894
01:12:37.659 --> 01:12:40.546
Tell Ting to do it.
- Yes, Sir.

895
01:12:43.283 --> 01:12:45.114
Sir Shen.
- Where's Miaotong?

896
01:12:45.440 --> 01:12:47.088
I'm here to buy her freedom.

897
01:12:52.870 --> 01:12:54.313
Doctor Zhang.

898
01:12:56.271 --> 01:12:57.780
Doctor Zhang...

899
01:13:35.858 --> 01:13:37.309
Let her go.

900
01:13:43.786 --> 01:13:46.538
I'm aware that people say you
should never...

901
01:13:46.741 --> 01:13:48.274
kill doctors,

902
01:13:48.340 --> 01:13:49.932
but I had no choice.

903
01:13:50.001 --> 01:13:52.112
Someone paid a price for your head.

904
01:13:52.968 --> 01:13:54.628
A very high price.

905
01:13:55.951 --> 01:13:57.647
I plan to kill you anyway,

906
01:13:58.111 --> 01:14:00.009
so why not make some money?

907
01:14:00.091 --> 01:14:01.632
So let's not waste...

908
01:14:01.884 --> 01:14:03.454
any more time.

909
01:14:15.337 --> 01:14:16.952
You picked a good one.

910
01:14:17.369 --> 01:14:18.954
This girl...

911
01:14:20.842 --> 01:14:22.553
feels really good.

912
01:14:41.099 --> 01:14:42.720
Why aren't you packed?

913
01:14:46.450 --> 01:14:47.945
How is...

914
01:14:48.046 --> 01:14:49.484
Sir Yan?

915
01:14:50.312 --> 01:14:52.291
No big deal.
You don't need to pack.

916
01:14:52.376 --> 01:14:54.254
I'll buy you new things.

917
01:14:55.591 --> 01:14:57.099
How is Sir Yan?

918
01:15:01.408 --> 01:15:02.805
Miaotong...

919
01:15:03.554 --> 01:15:05.194
I have bought you freedom.

920
01:15:05.880 --> 01:15:07.375
We have to hurry.

921
01:15:07.801 --> 01:15:09.427
The gates will be closed soon.

922
01:15:12.994 --> 01:15:16.152
Where is Sir Yan?
What happened to him?

923
01:15:24.928 --> 01:15:26.766
I'm as good as dead.

924
01:15:28.222 --> 01:15:30.312
I can't imagine what else they
would do to me.

925
01:15:33.921 --> 01:15:35.536
You don't need to wait for him.

926
01:15:37.594 --> 01:15:39.046
He's dead.

927
01:15:42.315 --> 01:15:43.621
I don't believe you!

928
01:15:43.678 --> 01:15:45.961
You're only saying that so I'd
come with you.

929
01:15:47.908 --> 01:15:49.386
I'm waiting for him.

930
01:15:52.492 --> 01:15:54.098
I'm not lying.

931
01:15:57.235 --> 01:15:58.997
I have a huge favor to ask.

932
01:16:00.169 --> 01:16:02.856
Please kill me.
- I killed him.

933
01:16:04.454 --> 01:16:06.157
He begged me to.

934
01:16:10.830 --> 01:16:12.367
If you're dead...

935
01:16:12.516 --> 01:16:14.471
what am I supposed to say to her?

936
01:16:15.591 --> 01:16:17.151
You chopped off my hand.

937
01:16:18.242 --> 01:16:21.516
Kill me...
and we're even.

938
01:16:22.384 --> 01:16:24.007
You knew it was me?

939
01:16:34.776 --> 01:16:36.549
Tell Miaotong that...

940
01:16:37.885 --> 01:16:39.681
she doesn't need to wait for me.

941
01:16:43.078 --> 01:16:44.595
We have to hurry.

942
01:16:58.501 --> 01:17:00.710
We have a change only if we go now.

943
01:17:19.984 --> 01:17:21.416
Miaotong...

944
01:17:21.514 --> 01:17:23.336
we must leave.

945
01:17:26.698 --> 01:17:28.307
I was 12 years old...

946
01:17:31.049 --> 01:17:33.159
when Imperial Assassins ransacked
our house.

947
01:17:36.597 --> 01:17:38.382
It was also them...

948
01:17:40.631 --> 01:17:42.475
who brought me to this place.

949
01:17:50.441 --> 01:17:52.629
Ever since the first time I saw you.

950
01:17:53.496 --> 01:17:55.131
I've been scared of you.

951
01:17:56.167 --> 01:17:57.877
I hated your uniform...

952
01:17:58.936 --> 01:18:00.816
and that blade.

953
01:18:02.660 --> 01:18:04.393
You think I like you?

954
01:18:05.097 --> 01:18:06.575
I'm just scared of you.

955
01:18:14.605 --> 01:18:16.059
I know...

956
01:18:17.804 --> 01:18:19.690
you've been good to me,

957
01:18:21.392 --> 01:18:23.342
better than anyone.

958
01:18:24.862 --> 01:18:26.664
But I just can't let it go.

959
01:18:28.752 --> 01:18:30.632
I saw your face so clearly.

960
01:18:35.769 --> 01:18:37.756
On the day my family was ransacked.

961
01:18:39.527 --> 01:18:41.037
I saw you.

962
01:18:42.259 --> 01:18:44.584
You arrested my father with
your own hands.

963
01:18:48.849 --> 01:18:51.967
I don't know if I should hate you
or be grateful.

964
01:19:05.324 --> 01:19:07.345
Do you still want me to come with you?

965
01:19:09.819 --> 01:19:11.519
Sir Shen?

966
01:21:16.412 --> 01:21:18.041
Sir Han...

967
01:21:19.018 --> 01:21:21.329
the bones are not right.
He's too young.

968
01:21:21.575 --> 01:21:23.599
He can't be Wei Zhongxian.

969
01:21:39.807 --> 01:21:42.233
Only when you're dead,
can Godfather live in peace.

970
01:21:43.013 --> 01:21:45.160
Run for your life,
when you still can.

971
01:21:54.928 --> 01:21:57.491
Lui Jianxing...
you have deceived His Majesty!

972
01:21:57.601 --> 01:21:59.137
Throw down your weapon.

973
01:22:01.543 --> 01:22:03.169
Kill them.

974
01:22:45.924 --> 01:22:47.527
Miaotong.

975
01:22:48.205 --> 01:22:50.027
I'll take you to the doctor.

976
01:22:53.130 --> 01:22:54.496
Leave me alone.

977
01:22:54.948 --> 01:22:57.029
Jin Yichuan
is at the Bailu Clinic.

978
01:22:58.267 --> 01:22:59.979
Go find him.

979
01:23:14.611 --> 01:23:16.392
Why didn't you kill Wei Zhongxian?

980
01:23:16.585 --> 01:23:19.001
I wanted to live.
- It seems you want to die instead.

981
01:23:19.763 --> 01:23:21.300
Your Excellency,

982
01:23:21.557 --> 01:23:23.276
you have exposed yourself.

983
01:23:23.350 --> 01:23:24.695
So what?

984
01:23:26.051 --> 01:23:27.827
If I kill you three...

985
01:23:28.443 --> 01:23:31.152
I'll still be Commander
of the Secret Police tomorrow.

986
01:24:11.101 --> 01:24:12.964
You are so dead!
Not just you,

987
01:24:13.045 --> 01:24:14.657
but this woman aswell.

988
01:25:59.794 --> 01:26:02.504
Your Excellency!
Your Excellency...

989
01:26:03.866 --> 01:26:05.187
Your Excellency.

990
01:26:28.512 --> 01:26:30.270
If it weren't for me...

991
01:26:32.211 --> 01:26:34.831
you wouldn't end up like this.

992
01:27:34.413 --> 01:27:36.528
You will yourself cut like this.

993
01:27:42.432 --> 01:27:44.314
Even if I have one breath left.

994
01:27:44.597 --> 01:27:46.296
I'm gonna kill you!

995
01:28:00.920 --> 01:28:02.558
Those moves of yours...

996
01:28:02.765 --> 01:28:04.674
Master never taught me.

997
01:28:45.396 --> 01:28:46.810
You're such a wreck.

998
01:28:46.871 --> 01:28:48.795
Going on would be boring.

999
01:28:49.175 --> 01:28:51.784
Consider our score settled today.

1000
01:28:56.491 --> 01:28:58.035
Don't hurt the girl.

1001
01:29:00.170 --> 01:29:01.972
Don't hurt the girl.

1002
01:29:07.963 --> 01:29:09.580
What if I tell you...

1003
01:29:10.689 --> 01:29:13.056
that all I ever did
was kill her father,

1004
01:29:13.444 --> 01:29:15.499
and I never laid a finger on her!

1005
01:29:16.572 --> 01:29:18.138
Would you be happy?

1006
01:29:30.991 --> 01:29:32.436
This is the end.

1007
01:29:43.424 --> 01:29:45.160
But if I really kill you,

1008
01:29:48.105 --> 01:29:49.789
I'll be alone...

1009
01:29:53.589 --> 01:29:55.387
in this world.

1010
01:30:04.633 --> 01:30:06.181
Go away...

1011
01:30:19.972 --> 01:30:21.442
Lui Jianxing?

1012
01:30:21.506 --> 01:30:23.197
I am Lui Jianxing.

1013
01:30:24.120 --> 01:30:25.577
Your Honor.

1014
01:30:25.641 --> 01:30:28.354
Lui Jianxing...
did you let go of Wei Zhongxian?

1015
01:30:29.339 --> 01:30:31.258
Yes.
- Why?

1016
01:30:37.330 --> 01:30:38.927
So where is Wei...

1017
01:30:39.222 --> 01:30:40.876
at the moment?

1018
01:30:42.146 --> 01:30:43.567
I don't know.

1019
01:30:45.007 --> 01:30:46.631
Who ordered you to do that?

1020
01:30:47.159 --> 01:30:48.775
I took orders from no one...

1021
01:30:49.600 --> 01:30:51.171
and worked with no one!

1022
01:30:51.635 --> 01:30:53.382
It was all me.

1023
01:31:09.684 --> 01:31:11.079
Your Majesty...

1024
01:31:11.139 --> 01:31:13.641
would you like me to interrogate
Lui Jianxing?

1025
01:31:13.749 --> 01:31:15.998
I'll make sure he spill out the
other members.

1026
01:31:18.078 --> 01:31:19.953
I've already killed hundreds.

1027
01:31:20.469 --> 01:31:23.671
Even Yuan Chonghuan built a
temple for Wei.

1028
01:31:24.973 --> 01:31:26.496
Do you want to kill him too?

1029
01:31:27.203 --> 01:31:30.025
You want there to be no man
at my command?

1030
01:31:30.662 --> 01:31:32.103
I would never dare.

1031
01:31:32.491 --> 01:31:35.170
Don't let Lui Jianxing name
any more names.

1032
01:31:36.472 --> 01:31:38.440
Kill him!
- I understand.

1033
01:31:40.002 --> 01:31:41.852
Why is Zhao Jingzhong not here?

1034
01:31:42.246 --> 01:31:43.778
Zhao Jingzhong...

1035
01:31:45.186 --> 01:31:46.638
He disappeared.

1036
01:32:27.905 --> 01:32:29.731
<i>Clique Member Lui Jianxing...</i>

1037
01:32:30.592 --> 01:32:32.221
<i>to be executed!</i>

1038
01:32:35.572 --> 01:32:36.947
I'm sorry.

1039
01:32:40.167 --> 01:32:41.830
I'm so sorry for everything.

1040
01:32:45.757 --> 01:32:47.413
<i>The indentity of the criminal...</i>

1041
01:32:47.491 --> 01:32:49.185
<i>has been verified.</i>

1042
01:32:49.507 --> 01:32:50.778
<i>Execute!</i>

1043
01:33:05.272 --> 01:33:07.073
I'm so sorry for everything!

1044
01:33:18.145 --> 01:33:19.624
Sir Jin.

1045
01:33:47.957 --> 01:33:51.928
<i>[ North Frontier, War
Zone, 2 months later. ]</i>

1046
01:34:17.144 --> 01:34:19.406
He's still following us.
It's been two weeks now.

1047
01:34:19.503 --> 01:34:21.010
We just can't lose him.

1048
01:34:21.151 --> 01:34:22.624
It's Shen Lian.

1049
01:35:25.110 --> 01:35:26.542
Shen Lian!

1050
01:35:26.686 --> 01:35:28.232
I gave you a change to live,

1051
01:35:29.327 --> 01:35:31.176
and you came back to haunt me.

1052
01:35:31.940 --> 01:35:33.397
If I don't kill you,

1053
01:35:33.506 --> 01:35:35.236
I'm as good as dead.

1054
01:35:38.719 --> 01:35:40.664
You want
to avenge your sworn brothers?

1055
01:35:42.870 --> 01:35:44.458
Let me tell you something.

1056
01:35:44.777 --> 01:35:46.511
His Majesty only requested that...

1057
01:35:46.670 --> 01:35:48.602
Wei be taken back to the Capital,

1058
01:35:48.779 --> 01:35:50.613
but didn't want him dead.

1059
01:35:51.198 --> 01:35:52.831
It was me who wanted him dead.

1060
01:35:53.250 --> 01:35:54.461
You faked His Majesty's order.

1061
01:35:55.238 --> 01:35:56.941
Even if we killed Wei Zhongxian,

1062
01:35:57.127 --> 01:35:58.753
you would still kill us.

1063
01:36:01.389 --> 01:36:03.451
From the moment
I approached you three...

1064
01:36:04.816 --> 01:36:06.590
you were dead already.

1065
01:36:32.255 --> 01:36:34.878
Which of you is
General Li Yongfang's friend?

1066
01:36:39.226 --> 01:36:41.005
I am Zhao Jingzhong.

1067
01:36:42.646 --> 01:36:44.764
You're joining the Manchurians!

1068
01:36:46.548 --> 01:36:48.392
Those two Han men are enemies.

1069
01:36:55.474 --> 01:36:59.732
Kill him! Go...

1070
01:37:02.149 --> 01:37:03.774
As I said before,

1071
01:37:04.168 --> 01:37:05.659
you're suicidal!

1072
01:37:06.018 --> 01:37:09.275
<i>The reason why our country
is wrecked with problems...</i>

1073
01:37:09.769 --> 01:37:12.194
<i>and people can barely make
ends meet...</i>

1074
01:37:13.333 --> 01:37:15.521
<i>is because of people like you!</i>

1075
01:37:16.223 --> 01:37:17.860
<i>As long as I'm standing...</i>

1076
01:37:18.162 --> 01:37:20.390
you have no change of leaving alive.

1077
01:37:25.524 --> 01:37:27.356
Ding Xiu, is no match for them.

1078
01:37:27.572 --> 01:37:29.311
And you...

1079
01:37:30.073 --> 01:37:32.035
you really think you can kill me?

1080
01:37:50.925 --> 01:37:52.597
Arrows!

1081
01:39:38.836 --> 01:39:40.723
Your sidekick won't last
much longer.

1082
01:39:41.764 --> 01:39:43.237
Neither will you!

1083
01:40:27.325 --> 01:40:29.666
Why did you approach us three
in the first place?

1084
01:40:30.231 --> 01:40:32.410
You worthless people...

1085
01:40:34.141 --> 01:40:36.485
who would care if you died?

1086
01:40:37.698 --> 01:40:39.426
When I want you crushed,

1087
01:40:39.501 --> 01:40:40.970
you are crushed!

1088
01:40:41.979 --> 01:40:43.560
Zhao Jingzhong...

1089
01:40:43.889 --> 01:40:46.048
you're no longer
Commander of the Secret Police.

1090
01:40:46.399 --> 01:40:48.157
You lost everything...

1091
01:40:48.625 --> 01:40:50.635
thanks to us worthless people.

1092
01:43:08.291 --> 01:43:09.806
<i>Go down south,</i>

1093
01:43:10.098 --> 01:43:11.700
<i>to Suzhou.</i>

1094
01:43:12.693 --> 01:43:14.235
<i>When you get there...</i>

1095
01:43:14.637 --> 01:43:16.445
<i>go to Qijia Lane...</i>

1096
01:43:17.134 --> 01:43:18.929
<i>and find the second courtyard
on the left.</i>

1097
01:43:19.506 --> 01:43:20.842
<i>Your Zhou Miaotong...</i>

1098
01:43:20.901 --> 01:43:22.635
<i>and the Zhang girl...</i>

1099
01:43:23.155 --> 01:43:24.685
<i>are both there.</i>

1100
01:43:27.032 --> 01:43:28.883
Thank you.
- No need.

1101
01:43:30.701 --> 01:43:32.625
If you didn't kill Zhao Jingzhong...

1102
01:43:33.632 --> 01:43:35.625
I would have killed you both.

1103
01:44:20.894 --> 01:44:24.012
<i>Jianxing...
when we leave Beijing,</i>

1104
01:44:24.622 --> 01:44:26.778
<i>where would you want to go?
- Me?</i>

1105
01:44:27.347 --> 01:44:30.793
<i>To Quanzhou.
I want to show my mother the ocean,</i>

1106
01:44:31.380 --> 01:44:32.862
<i>and the big ships.</i>

1107
01:44:33.617 --> 01:44:35.282
<i>Lian, what about you?</i>

1108
01:44:36.915 --> 01:44:38.575
<i>Suzhou, I guess.</i>

1109
01:44:39.444 --> 01:44:40.846
<i>Enough about us.</i>

1110
01:44:41.033 --> 01:44:42.774
<i>Where do you want to go, Yichuan?</i>

1111
01:44:43.399 --> 01:44:45.079
<i>I want to go
beyond the northern borders.</i>

1112
01:44:45.166 --> 01:44:46.944
<i>I heard there are very few people there.</i>

1113
01:44:47.074 --> 01:44:50.105
<i>I wonder...
what that feels like.</i>
